Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.73,0:45:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.02,0:45:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是一场梦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.90,0:45:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我至今看到的都是恶梦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.26,0:45:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.86,0:45:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们13名勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.66,0:45:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,正在去讨伐克雷巴特斯的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.99,0:45:22.27,Default - TOP,,0,0,0,,喂 蠢蛋 看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.34,0:45:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.36,0:45:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,终于醒来啦 艾莉西亚
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.69,0:45:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,克…克雷恩
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.31,0:45:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看样子我们好像被抓了
